  message: "Fixed in PR (selfh/dev c62101604d). Behavioral evidence: with the grammar mocked unavailable, analyze_circom('/tmp').run.toolchain was the str 'tree-sitter-circom' and run.to_dict()['toolchain'].get('name') raised AttributeError: 'str' object has no attribute 'get' (the finalize._finalize_recompute_run_signature path). After fix, run.toolchain == {'name':'circom','version':'unknown'} (a dict), to_dict serializes a dict, and the finalize-style .get('name') returns 'circom' without crashing. Production-path test test_skip_toolchain_is_dict_not_str asserts the dict shape + the .get access. Distinct from INV-pitab symptom 2 (the toolchain.name='python' policy fork, still held)."  # 3d1c
